            "notes": "#### ROUND 2:\n\nSince our goal for now is to make money and harass backliners, [Sonic Recharger](item_c5e6a2c9-1bed-48fa-b539-01e76098a297) is going to give us some much needed survivability. You blink in with more health than a *Mei*, and recall to safety on repeat. It's so **annoying** to play vs this playstyle.",
