            "notes": "#### ROUND 4:\n\nFILL. YOUR. SLOTS. \n\nYour slots are a resource and it's important to maximize it.\n\n[Running shoes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900), [Winning attitude](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900), and [Ammo Reserves](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900) are all very efficient and help you make money. \n[Heartbeat Sensor](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900) helps you find low health targets to assassinate with your [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c) combo.",
