            "notes": "ROUND 5\n\n*SHOWTIME.*\n\n[Get Stuffed!](item_3b0530be-462d-4e2d-8b4d-05c027d6aa60) is the core of the build. At this point you melee so often, and so safely, that you're going to be spamming bombs like [Cassidy's](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) **[Fan the Hammer]**.\n\n[Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) marks the exodia setup being complete.\n\nThe combo works like this:\n\n[Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) triggers -> [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c), [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900), [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c), AND [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69), AND [Bloodbound](item_d873e953-93cd-4b0d-8669-33184127cc3c);\n [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) triggers -> [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c), [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900), [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c), AND [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69), AND [Bloodbound](item_d873e953-93cd-4b0d-8669-33184127cc3c);\n [Geneticist's Vial](item_c7443757-9e2a-4be8-b3a3-469ab64b0e9d) triggers -> [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c), [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900), [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c), AND [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69), AND [Bloodbound](item_d873e953-93cd-4b0d-8669-33184127cc3c);\n ANOTHER [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) triggers -> [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c), [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900), [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c), AND [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69), AND [Bloodbound](item_d873e953-93cd-4b0d-8669-33184127cc3c); \nYOUR FIRST ACTUAL DEATH triggers -> [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c), [Electrolytes](item_274b7523-8273-4740-aa7b-837f3f143900), [Junker Whatchamajig](item_b81ebab8-5c85-405a-b28d-2496de33cd9c), AND [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69), AND [Bloodbound](item_d873e953-93cd-4b0d-8669-33184127cc3c);\n\nExplain to me how this got past the playtest team.",
